+    e. **Loss Calculation:**
         *   **Similarity Loss:** $L_{sim} = -E_{img}(I_{ROI})^T E_{txt}(y)$ [S1].
         *   **Transmittance Loss:** $L_T = -\min(\tau, \text{mean}(T(P)))$, where $T(P)$ is the transmittance of the rendered view from pose $P$ [S1].
